{"operations":[{"content":"# Summary\n\nThe agreement's allocation rule for plots is: \"Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement.\" [[cite:obs-e4cc585320443fca427970290809b27059098507 \"Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement.\"]]\n\nThe agreement does not specify any physical dimensions for a plot; the only statement about plots in the agreement is \"Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement.\" [[cite:obs-e4cc585320443fca427970290809b27059098507 \"Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement.\"]]\n","expected_sha256":"be4ae848eb9d09747fdee5aaccc52bf74dffc65863adf2e15dd25cc6c25bb85c","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"State the allocation rule and explicitly say the agreement gives no plot size, with each statement followed by an exact quoted citation from the agreement."}